{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-04T18:48:46.525Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"edac964870aa73c4248d5ad0","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T18:48:46.525Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"Focused suites passed 57/57. Lint, zero-duplication and docstring gates passed. The first full release run used the implicit sibling directory as its fleet root and saw unrelated worktrees, causing three catalog/snapshot assertions to fail (459/462 pass). The supported PM_FLEET_ROOT override points at the canonical fleet; all 12 catalog assertions pass with that setting. Retry the full release gate with this repo-relative environment override. Hardened cleanup-failure injection with a connection-scoped PostgreSQL statement trigger to avoid dependence on concurrent retention sweeps."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-04T18:48:46.525Z"}],"before_hash":"9e27d330270a1cbd03f827460776efee070ed8cf7bfd13299bd8c689782dafa9","after_hash":"0b14d7c98ed8a124afc8bd4fa3c30489d4dbb0a8a0ba3324be24154b4828edce","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fbc78522b0b187b37fefb26872d5545736ceb454ca6e80870d55326033deadb6"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-04T18:53:44.872Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"edac964870aa73c4248d5ad0","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-04T18:53:44.872Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"PR #170 round two: all seven findings fixed. 4178787252: capture the tab account before sending and preserve it after network failure. 4178787257: every replay sends X-PM-Expected-Account; the server returns 409 before execution or key claiming on mismatch, keeping the record. 4178739144: REBIND_RECORDS carries the approving account and the server verifies recovery approval. 4178739147: adoption and flush serialize; adoption reads and writes in one IndexedDB transaction and keeps existing keys. 4178739152: auth routes never queue, key or replay stored responses, including legacy auth records. 4178787261: missing/deleted token users bypass keying; live login/logout work. 4178787264: retention runs before claims; a real PostgreSQL cleanup failure leaves no pending key and retry succeeds. Test-first reproduction: 55 tests, 44 pass, 11 fail; focused fixed suites: 57/57. Final npm run release:check passed through pm test with PM_FLEET_ROOT=../../fleet: 462/462 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations; 33 source files reported; coverage 85.00% lines, 81.45% branches, 78.61% functions; thresholds unchanged at 79/79/75. Lint/typecheck/build, zero duplication, docstrings, production audit, packed npm/Bun acceptance, changelog and release verification passed. Whole-repository four-metric 100% coverage remains outside this review slice. README and test links updated; leave the item open for orchestrator verification."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-04T18:53:44.872Z"}],"before_hash":"0b14d7c98ed8a124afc8bd4fa3c30489d4dbb0a8a0ba3324be24154b4828edce","after_hash":"3b037063508f5fece429f809afeeef079708fe6411f68e11e5f2abff273da6b8","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e06e15cbbd09fe085328be383b6cb252265f9c518bd330cc18fac9908908940f"}
